the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    goal.
    illegal.
    *a thing* is a base.
    *a thing* is a hue.
    *a thing* is a region.
    *a thing* is the color of *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the next of *a second thing*.

the knowledge base mapcoloring includes:

the text of the ruleset is at "sources/mapcoloring.rules".

goal if
    r1 is the color of a thing
    and r2 is the color of a second thing
    and r3 is the color of a third thing
    and r4 is the color of a fourth thing
    and r5 is the color of a fifth thing
    and r6 is the color of a sixth thing.

illegal if
    a thing is the next of a second thing
    and the thing is the color of a third thing
    and the second thing is the color of the third thing.

